---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/build-night-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/build-night-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Asked at 7:24, first scores at 11:16"
  caption="One evening. The thick bar is the 41-minute scoring run."
>
  Timeline of one evening. At 7:24 PM I ask for a first pass, with about 300 applications already in. By 10:15 PM my calls are made. A 41-minute scoring run ends at 11:16 PM with the first 360 applications scored.
</Chart>
